Lots of groups do just that sort of thing (see the Pratchett fangroups
for serious tagging!). Trouble is that in rgrn almost every thread
should be tagged spoiler, and an alternative of using a [nospoilers]
tag would only be useful for visitors and newbies who wouldn't know to
use it anyway.

People are pretty good about [S] tagging, though.

>BTW, is anybody actually using the "jump to next" feature to read all
