I do in text groups that I read regularly - it's faster for me to hit
"n" and scan for interesting stuff (and hit "i" for ignore thread if
necessary) than it is to move back and forth from the message list
pane. 

If I'm a temporary visitor to a group I'll grab just headers and pick
and choose which threads to pull - then use n&i to go through them.

